-------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
With PCH.IOE global reset on G3/DeepSx Exit boots due to USB3DBC change

[Feature Description]
The scenario is while debug IFWI (MEEN is enabled), PlatformDebugOption
(PDO) default is set to Trace Ready, and system boot from G3.

In such case, for PCH.IOE since there is no RTC power, the DCI USB3DBC
setting goes back to hardware default 1. With PDO set to Trace Ready,
BIOS will set USB3DBC to 0.

This change is to skip the global reset when USB3DBC from 1 -> 0 in
such scenario. This follows the implementation as PCD-S for PCH.IOE.

Package/Module:OneSiliconPkg/Dci

[Impacted Platform]
HX

