-------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
Add firmware-level unit testing support for LPSS I2C.

[Feature Description]
Increase LPSS I2C code quality by adding firmware-level unit
testing support and preparing register macros. The change
introduces standardized register bit masks, field positions,
and numeric shifts, and replaces several packed register unions
with explicit Data32 operations so the code can manipulate register
fields with clear macros. It refactors initialization, clock/divider
configuration, reset handling to use the new macros and explicit
reads/writes, enabling isolated unit tests of MMIO register behavior
and simplifying validation of I2C controller logic.

Revert commit.

