-------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
Add unit testing support for LPSS UART and prepare register macros.

[Feature Description]
Increase LPSS UART code quality by adding firmware-level unit testing
support and preparing register macros. The change introduces
standardized register bit masks, field positions, and numeric shifts,
and replaces several packed register unions with explicit Data32
operations so the code can manipulate register fields with clear
macros. It refactors initialization, clock/divider configuration,
reset handling to use the new macros and explicit reads/writes,
enabling isolated unit tests of MMIO register behavior and
simplifying validation of SPI controller logic.

