Move PCH PCIe Root Port BAR programing to Early Init

[Feature Description]i
PCH PCIe Root Port BAR programming (NvlPchPcieRpProgramBar)
executed at Post-Memory initialization in
NvlPchPcieRootPortsInit function. It is to late to:
- Enable 64-bit BAR and Data "Prefetchable"
- Enable the BAR in RCRB Memory BAR Control register
The BAR programming shall be moved as early as possible,
before any PCIe RP registers access.
The programming has been moved to Pre-Memory phase,
to NvlPchPcieRpEarlyInit()

