[COMMON] SAGV G2 fast boot enabling
[Feature Description]
SAGV G2 fast boot enabling
1. For fast boot, use the same  retoring order as the cold boot training order.
2. Disabling ph fsm by setting PHFsmStart = 0 before restoring, and setting back to POR value 3 after restoring.
3. Disable MC QCLK before restoring DDRIO crs and enable MC QCLK after restoring the DDRIO crs.
5. After restoring the CRs, disable MCQCLK, doing a DLL reset, then enable the MCQCLK, and setting the PHFsmStart back to POR value 3.
6. Keep the MC QCLK pi code value unchanged during restoring.

Package/Module: MemoryInit

[Impacted Platform]
